---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Use">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[var(--content-max-width)] px-6 py-24">
    <div class="max-w-[var(--reading-max-width)]">
      <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Effective date: [TODO: effective date]</p>

      <p class="mt-6 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        These Terms of Use govern access to and use of the Clockwork Otter Foundry website.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        By using this website, you agree to use it lawfully and in accordance with these Terms.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-12">Informational Purpose</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        This website provides information about Clockwork Otter Foundry, its work, and its
        products or projects.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        The website does not currently provide user accounts, payment processing, e-commerce
        transactions, or hosted software-as-a-service functionality.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        Information on the website may change as products and projects develop.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-12">Antiphon and Other Software</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        Descriptions of Antiphon or other software on this website are informational.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        Use, distribution, licensing, purchase, or other rights relating to Antiphon or future
        Clockwork Otter Foundry software are governed by the license or other terms specifically
        provided with that software, not by these website Terms of Use.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-12">Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        Unless otherwise stated, the website's original branding, logo artwork, written content,
        site design elements, and other original materials are owned by or licensed to Clockwork
        Otter Foundry and are protected by applicable intellectual-property laws.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        Third-party names, trademarks, standards, technologies, and other materials remain the
        property of their respective owners.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        Public availability of the website or its source repository does not by itself waive
        applicable intellectual-property rights or grant permission to use Clockwork Otter Foundry
        trademarks or branding.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        If any website source code is intentionally distributed under an open-source license, that
        license governs the covered source code.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-12">Acceptable Use</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        You may use the website for lawful informational purposes.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">You may not intentionally:</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        <li>interfere with the operation or security of the website;</li>
        <li>attempt unauthorized access to systems or services;</li>
        <li>use the website in violation of applicable law; or</li>
        <li>misrepresent yourself or another party as being affiliated with Clockwork Otter Foundry.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="mt-12">Third-Party Links and Services</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        The website may link to third-party websites, repositories, services, standards bodies, or
        other resources.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        Clockwork Otter Foundry does not control those third-party services and is not responsible
        for their content, availability, security, or privacy practices.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        A link does not necessarily constitute endorsement.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-12">Accuracy and Availability</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        We aim to provide useful and accurate information, but website content may contain errors,
        become outdated, or change as products and projects evolve.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        The website is provided on an "as available" basis to the extent permitted by applicable
        law.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-12">No Professional Advice</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        Website content is provided for general informational purposes and should not be treated
        as legal, tax, accounting, regulatory, or other professional advice.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        This is particularly important for information concerning electronic invoicing standards
        or compliance. Users remain responsible for determining the requirements that apply to
        their own systems and circumstances.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-12">Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        To the extent permitted by applicable law, Clockwork Otter Foundry will not be liable for
        indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or similar losses arising solely from use of
        or inability to use this informational website.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-12">Changes to the Website or Terms</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        We may update the website and these Terms from time to time.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        When these Terms are materially updated, the effective date at the top of the page should
        be updated.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-12">Governing Law</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        [TODO: governing jurisdiction — do not finalize until confirmed]
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-12">Contact</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Questions about these Terms may be sent to:</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        <a href="mailto:info@clockworkotterfoundry.com" class="font-medium">info@clockworkotterfoundry.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
